    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 34,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## Interpretation and intentionally disabled collection\n- A query is one POST to patient-routing, analyze, hospitals/recommend, or hospitals/semantic-recommendations. Follow-up submissions count separately.\n- Cost is provider-confirmed usage from each OpenRouter network attempt, including retries. Missing cost is unknown. Known daily cost may understate actual charges. USD/query compares totals in the same hourly window; it is not per-request billing.\n- **CPU/memory: not collected. Container Insights remains disabled.**\n- **Uptime: not measured.** Planned demo shutdowns are not outages. A future independent probe must run only during agreed demo windows. Request success is not uptime.\n- OpenRouter spending is separate from your AWS bill. No patient data is included in these metric events."
      }
    }
